. * ============================
. * Analysis
. * ============================
. 
. use "$DATA/h3_dataset.dta", clear

. 
. 
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3: Having daughters leads to more gender equality in t
> he household (as measured by behaviors or outcomes). *
. 
.         * Model: Fixed-effects linear regression (xtreg)
.         * Dependent variable = left-leaning attitudes (factorial score of plh
> 0016 - plh002)
.         * Independent variable: number of years with daughter(s)
.         * Control variables: age, education, life satisfaction, political int
> erest
. 
.         *xtset
.         xtset pid syear

